{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/fb8eee5592428df11c9385f3b4b9d7ef.poster.avif?t=1757952032\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/fb8eee5592428df11c9385f3b4b9d7ef.webm?t=1757952032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/fb8eee5592428df11c9385f3b4b9d7ef.mp4?t=1757952032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synthetic Hopes</strong> is a puzzle game with original and systemic mechanics sparkled with a few platforming action sequences. In a cyberpunk world where androids have been reduced to slavery, you are a first-generation model that finally has a shot at freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the lights to advance. Pickup and combine elements to create new mixtures. Clear obstacles and create paths where there is none. Learn the ways of the world and maybe you\u2019ll have a chance to break the cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/2036d97483910271928f3dceade64012.poster.avif?t=1757952032\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/2036d97483910271928f3dceade64012.webm?t=1757952032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/2036d97483910271928f3dceade64012.mp4?t=1757952032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ puzzles to solve by mixing colors and states of matter, with a range of systemic mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgiving platforming and checkpoint system so you will spend most of your time actually learning and solving puzzles instead of trying to execute sequences perfectly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about meaning, resilience and facing overwhelming odds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original art and soundtrack that set the both hopeful and dystopian cyberpunk setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorblind mode : as the game is very focused on colors and their combinations, a colorblind mode will add shapes to the colors so that you can still play if they\u2019re hard to distinguish.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome To Synthetic Hopes!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578060/4b4e34d9fe07f217af5f78c438f7c9c9ef3eff09.jpg"},{"name":"Escape The Warehouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578060/0623926b2dd9ae597a759de2aa9cbb4f01d56175.jpg"},{"name":"The Apartment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578060/b8a5f6d622ca7d3ae4e6d2d2640a470ee90e440e.jpg"},{"name":"Fight Or Fly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578060/a772ef52763fb264236e512a37b632c142637773.jpg"},{"name":"Where It Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578060/e65ce2740e06b2dafe709d5dac711a439b773109.jpg"},{"name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578060/5ea1fb2a96824a0668028f97981bebcdabbe5a3f.jpg"},{"name":"Coloriage Magique","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578060/7a1a155c9f676853ddc8c3c588b5a1038b57e7f8.jpg"},{"name":"Happy Little Accidents","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578060/89c721c163cf68d9a367aa5213e9aa62c00b0276.jpg"},{"name":"Cheapskate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578060/0abf3bd5f7c9b8b3f8de4b77b287f884df4158f8.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta Go Fast!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578060/ce9bc40612ef20d63bef1bb1a0302c9a512c53da.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578060?t=1757952032","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/02f1453c0e3fbfab5ab79672a47ed36880de533f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757952032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/127b428325121edbfa2789e6d2064012cd64f98f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757952032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/127b428325121edbfa2789e6d2064012cd64f98f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757952032","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3658130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/fb8eee5592428df11c9385f3b4b9d7ef.poster.avif?t=1757952032\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/fb8eee5592428df11c9385f3b4b9d7ef.webm?t=1757952032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/fb8eee5592428df11c9385f3b4b9d7ef.mp4?t=1757952032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synthetic Hopes</strong> is a puzzle game with original and systemic mechanics sparkled with a few platforming action sequences. In a cyberpunk world where androids have been reduced to slavery, you are a first-generation model that finally has a shot at freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the lights to advance. Pickup and combine elements to create new mixtures. Clear obstacles and create paths where there is none. Learn the ways of the world and maybe you\u2019ll have a chance to break the cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/2036d97483910271928f3dceade64012.poster.avif?t=1757952032\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/2036d97483910271928f3dceade64012.webm?t=1757952032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/extras/2036d97483910271928f3dceade64012.mp4?t=1757952032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ puzzles to solve by mixing colors and states of matter, with a range of systemic mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgiving platforming and checkpoint system so you will spend most of your time actually learning and solving puzzles instead of trying to execute sequences perfectly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about meaning, resilience and facing overwhelming odds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original art and soundtrack that set the both hopeful and dystopian cyberpunk setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorblind mode : as the game is very focused on colors and their combinations, a colorblind mode will add shapes to the colors so that you can still play if they\u2019re hard to distinguish.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Groovy Snail Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578060/daac14a180fcccfa45f3bbcf27217b446812c506/header.jpg?t=1757952032","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3578060/946435274/3a4ffeaaf63fe019b81a0bccbf68489295d34581/1757359194/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757361563","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3578060/946435274/3a4ffeaaf63fe019b81a0bccbf68489295d34581/1757359194/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757361563","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3578060/946435274/3a4ffeaaf63fe019b81a0bccbf68489295d34581/1757359194/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757361563","id":257194699,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194699/c12503fec3af86e3e1de443ec0f0811bf5723e66/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757361563"}],"name":"Synthetic Hopes","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Synthetic Hopes - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$9.99</span> $5.99 USD","packageid":1262336,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-40% ","price_in_cents_with_discoun